1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,250
At TheOneApp Station, every pupil has a character of their very own.

2
00:00:08,808 --> 00:00:11,045
Oh wait, why is that one all grey?

3
00:00:11,065 --> 00:00:15,094
Does he know he gets 100 free credits for completing the tutorial?

4
00:00:15,114 --> 00:00:15,934
And look.

5
00:00:15,974 --> 00:00:17,554
The Gift Shop is dark.

6
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,540
Here, style is not given.

7
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:20,740
It is earned.

8
00:00:21,144 --> 00:00:23,164
Every quiz you finish earns credits.

9
00:00:23,184 --> 00:00:24,290
Let's start!

10
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:26,420
Which one will a magnet attract?

11
00:00:26,483 --> 00:00:27,845
We need a scientist.

12
00:00:27,865 --> 00:00:29,202
We need you.

13
00:00:30,292 --> 00:00:32,720
A magnet attracts things made of iron.

14
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:33,900
Quiz finished!

15
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,230
Ten credits!

16
00:00:35,629 --> 00:00:37,709
Day by day, the credits add up.

17
00:00:37,829 --> 00:00:39,619
They are earned, never bought.

18
00:00:40,222 --> 00:00:41,922
The Gift Shop is open!

19
00:00:42,072 --> 00:00:44,362
Safety goggles, fifty credits.

20
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:47,020
The colours are free.

21
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,180
And the goggles?

22
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,463
Yours to keep!

23
00:00:49,483 --> 00:00:50,833
Spin it in the mirror.

24
00:00:50,953 --> 00:00:52,833
Then take it into every game.

25
00:00:56,532 --> 00:00:57,572
Versus!

26
00:00:57,722 --> 00:00:59,522
Your character against me!

27
00:01:03,123 --> 00:01:03,973
Iron!

28
00:01:04,133 --> 00:01:05,343
You remembered!

29
00:01:05,393 --> 00:01:06,753
What you learn, you keep.

30
00:01:06,923 --> 00:01:08,233
What you earn, you wear.

31
00:01:08,835 --> 00:01:09,722
Earn it.

32
00:01:09,742 --> 00:01:10,557
Wear it.

33
00:01:10,577 --> 00:01:11,617
Play it.

34
00:01:11,765 --> 00:01:13,965
The only app you need to learn Science.

35
00:01:14,085 --> 00:01:15,125
TheOneApp.
